# UI feature tests

- New or changed reader/home UI should include **`test-<feature-slug>.js`** at repo root (Puppeteer).
- Follow **`AGENT_GUIDELINES.md`** → *Quality Gates* → *UI feature tests* for the review → infer → build → run loop and server URL notes.
- Existing examples: `test-title-inline-nav.js`, `test-library-buttons.js`, `test-title-page-dashboard.js`.
